mission "The Storm Line"
    name "The Storm Line"
    description "Break the five warships at the Storm Line, then return to Last Light to meet the free captains."
    source "Saint's Refuge"
    destination "Last Light"
    reward 1250
    objective kills 5
    battlefield "The Storm Line" 18215.7 8520.2
    enemy "The Storm Line Guard 1"
    enemy "The Storm Line Guard 2"
    enemy "The Storm Line Guard 3"
    enemy "The Storm Line Guard 4"
    enemy "The Storm Line Guard 5"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "A Harbour for the Hunted: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Five Company warships patrol the storm line, screening the Meridian Star.`
            `The deserters have given you the patrol schedule. If the screen is broken, Ashcombe must choose between fleeing into open ocean or defending his repair base.`
            `This is the largest fleet you have faced. Use your escorts, keep the wind on your quarter, and do not let all five ships bring their broadsides to bear.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `This is the largest fleet you have faced. Use your escorts, keep the wind on your quarter, and do not let all five ships bring their broadsides to bear.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The deserters mark the route in chalk. “They believe the storm will hide them. Let the weather hide us instead.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Storm Line. Break the five warships at the Storm Line, then return to Last Light to meet the free captains."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The patrol line is broken. Ashcombe has abandoned his repair base and fled west with the Meridian Star.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The free captains have one last chance to stop him before he reaches the old Caribbean.`
        log "Completed The Storm Line. Received 1250 gold. The free captains have one last chance to stop him before he reaches the old Caribbean."
